{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56824","headline":"大历间五台山童子赠无着偈（题拟） · 不详","name":"大历间五台山童子赠无着偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"面上无瞋供养具，口里无瞋吐妙香。\n心里无瞋是珍宝，无染无垢是真常。\n（同前）（按：《五灯会元》卷九《无着文喜禅师》云此偈爲杭州无着文喜禅师大中初至五台山华严寺见童子说偈。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}